  "authors": [],
  "body": {
    "comment": "I vote ABSTAIN on \"State of the Cardano Developer Ecosystem - 2026 Survey\" because it does not ask DReps to approve spending, change policy, or make an on-chain decision. The survey can help reveal developer needs and improve future funding choices, but its results should be read as open, self-selected data rather than a representative vote. Abstaining follows the proposal's own guidance while keeping a clear record that I support evidence-based developer feedback."
  },
  "hashAlgorithm": "blake2b-256"
}